<p>Yeh Pak Nabi (saw) Kay Ghar Ka Matam Hai<br>
Jo Sajday Main Qatal Hua Us Hadi (as) Ka Matam Hai</p>

<p>Asghar (as) Ko Pani Nahi Dia Masoom Ko Teer Mara Hai<br>
Kalma Parhnay Waloon Ki Bay Dardi Ka Matam Hai</p>

<p>Tum Nay Pak Muhammad (saw) Ki Aulad Ko Ban Main Rulaya Hai<br>
Yeh Kofay Kay Musalmanoon Ki Bay Ahadi Ka Matam Hai</p>

<p>Yeh Laila (sa) Ki Khuwahish Thi Kay Akbar (as) Ko Dulha Banaoon<br>
Jo Shadi Jangal Main Hue Us Shadi Ka Matam Hai</p>

<p>Zainab (sa) Ki Chadar Lutnaa Sajjad (as) Kay Liye Mout Say Barh Kar Tha<br>
Jo Chalees (40) Saal Khoon Roya Hai Us Qaidi Ka Matam Hai</p>

<p>Jis Nay Kofay Ki Aurat Ko Parday Ki Taleem Di Thi<br>
Us Shehar Main Bay Chadar Us Shahzadi (sa) Ka Matam Hai</p>

<p>Azad Us Nay Qaid Reh Kay Matam Ki Bunyaad Rakhi Hai<br>
Ek Saal Baad Zainab (sa) Ki Azadi Ka Matam Hai</p>